WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.152 --> 00:00:13.378
Mr. was very upset.

2
00:00:13.818 --> 00:00:14.798
He wrung his hands.

3
00:00:16.479 --> 00:00:17.500
He paced the floor.

4
00:00:18.960 --> 00:00:21.241
Beads of sweat dripped down his forehead.

5
00:00:21.261 --> 00:00:27.084
"The vegetable parade is supposed to start in twenty minutes," he cried.

6
00:00:28.252 --> 00:00:31.795
"A hundred people will be coming, and they are expecting a parade.

7
00:00:32.195 --> 00:00:33.216
What am I going to do?"

8
00:00:35.058 --> 00:00:36.118
Suddenly Mr.

9
00:00:36.199 --> 00:00:37.079
Chen stood up.

10
00:00:37.099 --> 00:00:39.821
"I'm a magician," he said.

11
00:00:39.841 --> 00:00:42.123
"Maybe I can help you."

12
00:00:43.745 --> 00:00:45.566
Mr. Scary scowled at him.

13
00:00:45.586 --> 00:00:48.588
"Can you make vegetables reappear?"

14
00:00:49.029 --> 00:00:49.649
he asked.

15
00:00:49.669 --> 00:00:52.271
"No," said Mr.

16
00:00:53.620 --> 00:00:56.002
Chen. "But I can put on a fabulous magic show.

17
00:00:56.383 --> 00:00:58.004
I brought along some of my props."

18
00:00:58.024 --> 00:01:02.349
"My dad is a great magician!"

19
00:01:02.789 --> 00:01:03.350
said Jenny.

20
00:01:03.370 --> 00:01:06.873
"People love his tricks," added Josh.

21
00:01:08.374 --> 00:01:10.216
Mr. Scary was still frowning.

22
00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:14.040
"Are you sure you can entertain one hundred people?"

23
00:01:14.500 --> 00:01:15.121
he asked.

24
00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:17.683
"Yes," said Mr.

25
00:01:17.763 --> 00:01:22.366
Chen. "Well, okay, but your show had better be good!"

26
00:01:22.746 --> 00:01:23.267
said Mr.

27
00:01:23.347 --> 00:01:28.751
Scary. "I'll go to my room and get my magic things," he told Mr.

28
00:01:28.791 --> 00:01:34.174
Scary. "Just one thing: do you have a chicken I can borrow for my first trick?"

29
00:01:35.195 --> 00:01:38.077
Mr. Scary looked surprised, but he nodded.

30
00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:41.719
"Yes, we have chickens here," he said.

31
00:01:41.739 --> 00:01:44.942
"They lay fresh eggs for breakfast."

32
00:01:44.962 --> 00:01:47.003
"A chicken?"

33
00:01:47.363 --> 00:01:47.804
I thought.

34
00:01:48.364 --> 00:01:49.045
What was Mr.

35
00:01:49.125 --> 00:01:50.826
Chen going to use a chicken for?

36
00:01:51.186 --> 00:01:53.367
I hoped he wasn't going to make chicken soup!

37
00:01:54.748 --> 00:01:55.369
I heard Mr.

38
00:01:55.429 --> 00:01:56.710
Chen whisper to Josh.

39
00:01:56.730 --> 00:01:59.652
"Can you come upstairs with me to get Bunch?

40
00:02:00.092 --> 00:02:01.533
I'll need him for my last trick."

41
00:02:03.154 --> 00:02:04.615
Josh went upstairs with Mr.

42
00:02:04.695 --> 00:02:08.477
Chen. Mr.

43
00:02:08.558 --> 00:02:09.718
Scary left too.

44
00:02:11.459 --> 00:02:14.782
Mr. Scary came back a few minutes later, carrying a chicken.

45
00:02:14.802 --> 00:02:16.463
"Cluck! Cluck!"

46
00:02:16.963 --> 00:02:17.984
squawked the chicken.

47
00:02:18.988 --> 00:02:22.190
Families were beginning to file in for the vegetable parade.

48
00:02:24.051 --> 00:02:26.292
Mr. Scary walked to the front of the room.

49
00:02:30.134 --> 00:02:31.695
He was still holding the chicken.

50
00:02:31.715 --> 00:02:34.797
"I have an announcement," he said.

51
00:02:34.817 --> 00:02:39.139
"We will not be having our family vegetable parade today."

52
00:02:39.159 --> 00:02:42.201
"Boo!" someone yelled.

53
00:02:42.221 --> 00:02:47.444
"What a shame," said a woman in a blue hat.

54
00:02:48.568 --> 00:02:51.050
"I wanted to learn how to make vegetable soup."

55
00:02:51.070 --> 00:02:57.455
"I was really excited about the vegetable parade," added a little kid in the front.

56
00:02:57.475 --> 00:03:01.138
"I wanted to see the celery march into the soup pot!"

57
00:03:02.619 --> 00:03:05.401
Mr. Scary held his hand up for silence.

58
00:03:06.762 --> 00:03:09.444
"I know how disappointing this is," he said.

59
00:03:09.464 --> 00:03:14.308
"But instead of a vegetable parade, we are having a magic show."

60
00:03:15.648 --> 00:03:18.790
By now more families had come into the Lake Lounge.

61
00:03:19.710 --> 00:03:20.491
They heard Mr.

62
00:03:20.571 --> 00:03:21.692
Scary's announcement.

63
00:03:21.712 --> 00:03:25.414
"Yay! A magic show!"

64
00:03:25.834 --> 00:03:27.455
cried a little girl in pigtails.

65
00:03:27.475 --> 00:03:29.836
"That's so cool!"

66
00:03:30.196 --> 00:03:32.098
said a tall boy sitting in the back.

67
00:03:32.118 --> 00:03:36.660
"I love magic shows," said a red-haired woman.

68
00:03:37.741 --> 00:03:38.301
I agreed.

69
00:03:39.142 --> 00:03:42.724
A magic show was much more fun than a vegetable parade.

70
00:03:44.864 --> 00:03:45.424
But Mr.

71
00:03:45.524 --> 00:03:49.405
Scary looked surprised that people were excited about the magic show.

72
00:03:50.706 --> 00:03:51.286
Soon Mr.

73
00:03:51.366 --> 00:03:55.027
Chen came back with his big suitcase of magic things.

74
00:03:56.027 --> 00:03:58.928
Josh came with him, leading Bunch on his leash.

75
00:04:00.809 --> 00:04:03.329
Mr. Chen quickly set up his first trick.

76
00:04:03.349 --> 00:04:10.611
"Ladies and gentlemen, boys and girls," he said, "I am going to begin with a spectacular trick."

77
00:04:11.972 --> 00:04:12.512
"What is it?"

78
00:04:12.864 --> 00:04:14.806
called the tall boy in the back of the room.

79
00:04:16.507 --> 00:04:18.889
Mr. Chen took the chicken from Mr.

80
00:04:18.989 --> 00:04:24.193
Scary. "For my first trick, I am going to pull this chicken's head off!"

81
00:04:24.534 --> 00:04:26.075
Mr. Chen exclaimed.

82
00:04:27.096 --> 00:04:28.637
The audience gasped.

83
00:04:30.439 --> 00:04:31.720
Mr. Chen grinned.

84
00:04:31.740 --> 00:04:36.864
"And then," he went on, "I'm going to stick it right back on again."

85
00:04:36.884 --> 00:04:39.686
"Hooray!" I shouted.

86
00:04:41.836 --> 00:04:43.741
"Whew!" said the little girl with pigtails.

87
00:04:43.761 --> 00:04:46.588
"Squawk!" said the chicken.
